* ''One owner per registry; the floor reads by CID'' (operator ruling, 2026-10-18: //"Architecture stands, leans stand"//). The `@oracle` document as a registry every vessel writes retires: one id carried one `lares` and one `lararium` pointer for the whole fleet, and a joined vessel's pointer replaced its hearth's, a shape a two-vessel probe and three shard runs measured. `@oracle` stands as the floor's read-face over a manifest CID, which a wiki mounts read-only by the pin its vessel accepted. Each registry carries only what its scope's owner writes: a vessel's bootstrap holds its own document pointers and its control home its accepted floor pins; `@catalog` the operator's documents; the Kahu realm the live `lares` and `lararium` documents and their drafts; the Nexus's offer table, beside that realm, the signed offers any face makes toward canon (the house's decision, 2026-11-13, overrulable: the road takes the built door's form; <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/offering#/the-canon-offer`>>); the crossroads board the Nexus's one public answer. The leans the ruling adopts: the Kahu realm holds the live system documents, with `bags/` projected on the Kahu's vessel alone; a one-seat founding lands a counted 1-of-1 Kahu-cabal admission for persona zero's group, so one predicate decides every hand's reach into system canon; the release answer, the Nexus's one public answer, names the Nexus AID, the charter epoch, the release before it and the floor manifest CID, sealed by the steward, with the promotion approval over the manifest's exact bytes riding attached; a vessel records an accepted release as one pin per (vessel, Nexus) in its control home that only a person's act moves (operator ruling 2026-11-11: the vessel pins the floor, faces pin nothing); genesis bakes the first floor, a corpus CID in the seed. A signing domain of its own carries the release, `floor-release`, so no seal over another shape verifies as one (operator-approved, 2026-10-18). The shape and its slices stand at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/w26-floor-lane`>>; items `W26`, `W21` and `P8` carry the build.

